{"id":"ma_quina","lemma":"máquina","pos":"noun","rank":867,"glosses":["machine"],"ipa":"/ˈmakina/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"máquinas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-m%C3%A1quina.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Esta máquina de escribir es tuya?","en":"Is this typewriter yours?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537917","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to write"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"thuja"}]},{"text":"Las máquinas de escribir hacen mucho ruido.","en":"Typewriters are so noisy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639487","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to write"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"noise"}]},{"text":"¿Sabes cómo funciona esta máquina?","en":"Do you know how this machine works?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/554857","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"to work, to function","l":"funcionar"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"Este hospital tiene muchas máquinas nuevas.","en":"This hospital has a lot of new equipment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1189074","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"hospital"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null,{"g":"new","l":"nuevo"}]},{"text":"Hice andar la máquina.","en":"I got the machine running.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735744","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to walk, to go"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}